        "headline": "國防部偵獲中共17機艦船持續在台海周邊活動",
        "summary": "國防部指出，自7月31日上午6時至8月1日上午6時，共偵獲中共5架次軍機、10艘軍艦及2艘公務船持續在台海周邊活動。其中進入台灣西南及東部空域的軍機包括4架次輔戰機、直升機與無人機，以及1架東部直升機。國軍運用任務機艦及岸置飛彈系統嚴密監控應處。",
        "headline_en": "Taiwan Detects 17 Chinese Aircraft and Vessels Around Strait",
        "summary_en": "Taiwan's Ministry of National Defense stated that between 06:00 on July 31 and 06:00 on August 1, a total of 17 Chinese military aircraft, naval vessels, and official ships were detected operating around the Taiwan Strait. The detected assets included five aircraft entering Taiwan's southwestern and eastern airspace, ten naval vessels, and two official ships. According to the defense ministry, four auxiliary aircraft, helicopters, and drones were tracked in the southwestern airspace, while one helicopter was detected in eastern airspace. Taiwan's military monitored the activities using mission aircraft, naval vessels, and land-based missile systems.",
